{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Battle of Herone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Card Auto-Battler</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle of Herone is a strategic auto-battler where you assemble your army, choose heroes with unique powers, and watch your strategy come to life in automatic battles. Each round is divided into two distinct phases: the <strong>Shop Phase</strong>, where you plan, and the <strong>Battle Phase</strong>, where your decisions are put to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Core Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 Choose Your Hero<br>Each match begins by selecting from different heroes, each bringing unique cards and mechanics. Do you want to dominate the battlefield with fire spells or strengthen allies with constant healing? Your hero defines your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/f0fe8c359840a1db521caecfd7ec9765.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/f0fe8c359840a1db521caecfd7ec9765.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/f0fe8c359840a1db521caecfd7ec9765.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Troop Evolution<br>Combine three identical cards to upgrade your troops up to the maximum level 3, significantly boosting their stats. Timing and positioning are crucial to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/375701f462b2038b7c32ae4af18e0fa5.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/375701f462b2038b7c32ae4af18e0fa5.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/375701f462b2038b7c32ae4af18e0fa5.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2744\ufe0f Freeze, Reroll, Plan<br>Didn\u2019t find the right card? Reroll the shop for new options or freeze strategic ones for the next turn. Manage your gold wisely and prepare for big comebacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/0d13cae0812484a1ddc8452a3a0e6408.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/0d13cae0812484a1ddc8452a3a0e6408.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/0d13cae0812484a1ddc8452a3a0e6408.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Special Powers<br>Heroes not only bring exclusive cards but also unleash powerful abilities that can change the course of battle. Watch Tharion summon a devastating meteor that crashes onto the enemy field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/bd808d6d3c2cfcd4e60f4b7aebf1824f.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/bd808d6d3c2cfcd4e60f4b7aebf1824f.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/bd808d6d3c2cfcd4e60f4b7aebf1824f.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcca Detailed Statistics<br>After each fight, a complete panel shows damage dealt, healing performed, and troop attributes. Analyze, learn, and adjust your strategy for the upcoming rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/948f27afd7765cd96595c9eca8395b6a.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/948f27afd7765cd96595c9eca8395b6a.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/948f27afd7765cd96595c9eca8395b6a.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-phase gameplay: plan in the Shop Phase and watch it unfold in the Battle Phase. During combat, the statistics panel shows your army\u2019s real-time performance: damage dealt, damage received, and healing done by both you and your opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop management: spend your gold to buy troops, upgrade units, reroll for new cards, or freeze options for future turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical positioning: organize your troops on the board to maximize efficiency and explore synergies between units and heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic battles: focus on strategy while the combat plays out dynamically and independently, with no need for micromanagement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous PvP: face armies prepared by other players each turn, ensuring unpredictable and varied encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D top-down visuals: fast, clear, and exciting battles designed to be easy to follow and fun to watch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 In Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your army, choose your hero wisely, and watch your strategy unfold. In Battle of Herone, every shop decision echoes in battle \u2014 and only the sharpest tacticians will rise to the top.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015690?t=1764434194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/fe76fc1163a0609edfbc7a0da02adfb3f68c307d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764434194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/8f9aaa964dfb33bb32683490796f1a11e02573ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764434194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/8f9aaa964dfb33bb32683490796f1a11e02573ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764434194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Battle of Herone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Card Auto-Battler</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle of Herone is a strategic auto-battler where you assemble your army, choose heroes with unique powers, and watch your strategy come to life in automatic battles. Each round is divided into two distinct phases: the <strong>Shop Phase</strong>, where you plan, and the <strong>Battle Phase</strong>, where your decisions are put to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Core Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51 Choose Your Hero<br>Each match begins by selecting from different heroes, each bringing unique cards and mechanics. Do you want to dominate the battlefield with fire spells or strengthen allies with constant healing? Your hero defines your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/f0fe8c359840a1db521caecfd7ec9765.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/f0fe8c359840a1db521caecfd7ec9765.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/f0fe8c359840a1db521caecfd7ec9765.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Troop Evolution<br>Combine three identical cards to upgrade your troops up to the maximum level 3, significantly boosting their stats. Timing and positioning are crucial to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/375701f462b2038b7c32ae4af18e0fa5.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/375701f462b2038b7c32ae4af18e0fa5.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/375701f462b2038b7c32ae4af18e0fa5.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"