, learn, and adjust your strategy for the upcoming rounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/948f27afd7765cd96595c9eca8395b6a.poster.avif?t=1764434194\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/948f27afd7765cd96595c9eca8395b6a.webm?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/extras/948f27afd7765cd96595c9eca8395b6a.mp4?t=1764434194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-phase gameplay: plan in the Shop Phase and watch it unfold in the Battle Phase. During combat, the statistics panel shows your army\u2019s real-time performance: damage dealt, damage received, and healing done by both you and your opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop management: spend your gold to buy troops, upgrade units, reroll for new cards, or freeze options for future turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical positioning: organize your troops on the board to maximize efficiency and explore synergies between units and heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic battles: focus on strategy while the combat plays out dynamically and independently, with no need for micromanagement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asynchronous PvP: face armies prepared by other players each turn, ensuring unpredictable and varied encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D top-down visuals: fast, clear, and exciting battles designed to be easy to follow and fun to watch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 In Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your army, choose your hero wisely, and watch your strategy unfold. In Battle of Herone, every shop decision echoes in battle \u2014 and only the sharpest tacticians will rise to the top.</p>","developers":["Electronic Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015690/55f3df2443fdd6d7c2405e2f8d462b9f991b757c/header.jpg?t=1764434194","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015690/1717683978/f8ae4c5920d93db6189eedfc6fb0772ce859adcf/1758981197/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759066007","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015690/1717683978/f8ae4c5920d93db6189eedfc6fb0772ce859adcf/1758981197/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759066007","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015690/1717683978/f8ae4c5920d93db6189eedfc6fb0772ce859adcf/1758981197/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759066007","id":257201484,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201484/b898faaf2b8f511689dc0a77d833f990c2abe355/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759066007"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015690/1612067121/0baeb9bdc31d37ca1626c581864d2fd90726e16b/1758981229/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759066009","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015690/1612067121/0baeb9bdc31d37ca1626c581864d2fd90726e16b/1758981229/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759066009","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015690/1612067121/0baeb9bdc31d37c